      "side": 1,
      "message": "Re Situation #1:\n\nCorrection: My previous analysis was flawed. It\u0027s true that reserve doesn\u0027t modify `fPendingCount`, so a following reserve operation will also request a 4 count aligned offset. However, I missed that without a following append `fReservedCount` is never decremented. Consequently, the full amount of reserved space is returned, leaving no potential gaps.\n\n\nRe Situation #3:\nSee google chat. It\u0027s too long to post in here.",
